<%# 1.99yc: Pepe's PvP challenge knobs (pvpcfg.js) - !duel / !brawl accept + replacement rules. Saved on the site; Pepe
    reads them within 10 minutes (POST /api/pvp/cfg). public/js/admin-pvpcfg.js loads + saves it. Admins only. %>
<section class="adm-card" id="pvp" aria-labelledby="pvpT">
  <h2 id="pvpT">Duels &amp; brawls <span class="adm-pill admin">admins</span> <span class="adm-msg" id="pvpMsg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></h2>
  <% if (!locals.isAdmin) { %><p class="adm-help">Admins only.</p><% } else { %>
  <p class="adm-help">Pepe's <code>!duel</code> / <code>!brawl</code> challenges. The target must be in the challenger's room, and a challenge
    is accepted in the room it was made in (always on). A plain <code>!accept</code> only takes a challenge when nothing aimed at that person
    changed in the quiet window; otherwise Pepe shows the terms and wants <code>!accept X12</code>, so a challenger can't swap in a bigger
    fight right before the answer. Pepe picks changes up within 10 minutes. The accept time limit stays in Pepe's own admin panel (rate table).</p>
  <form id="pvpForm" class="adm-form" autocomplete="off" novalidate>
    <label for="pvpQuiet">Quiet window before a plain !accept (seconds, 0 = off)<input type="number" id="pvpQuiet" name="accept_quiet_secs" min="0" max="300" step="1" required></label>
    <label for="pvpMax">Challenges to the same person (incl. replacements)<input type="number" id="pvpMax" name="replace_max" min="1" max="20" step="1" required></label>
    <label for="pvpWin">... per (seconds)<input type="number" id="pvpWin" name="replace_window_secs" min="30" max="3600" step="1" required></label>
    <%# 1.99aco: the win-streak achievements' anti-farming rules (Pepe's pepe_pvpstreak.py). The achievement texts say 10,000+ PAT,
        "established" and (brawls) "evenly matched" - keep them in step if the stake floor moves. %>
    <h3 id="pvpStreakT" style="grid-column: 1 / -1; margin: var(--ds-sp-2) 0 0">Win-streak achievements (5 / 10 / 20 in a row)</h3>
    <p class="adm-help" id="pvpStreakHelp" style="grid-column: 1 / -1; margin: 0">A won duel or brawl that misses one of these doesn't extend
      the winner's streak (the loser's still resets). The opponent must be an established player: an account at least this old and at
      this level (an unknown one never counts). Brawls also need the opponent's sheet played and an even match. Each opponent counts once
      per 24 hours (repeats inside one streak are fine), never the winner's own alts (always on). The achievement texts say 10,000+ PAT.</p>
    <label for="pvpStake">Minimum stake (PAT, each side)<input type="number" id="pvpStake" name="streak_min_stake" min="1000" max="10000000" step="1000" required aria-describedby="pvpStreakHelp"></label>
    <label for="pvpDays">Opponent's account age (days)<input type="number" id="pvpDays" name="streak_min_acct_days" min="0" max="365" step="1" required aria-describedby="pvpStreakHelp"></label>
    <label for="pvpLevel">Opponent's level<input type="number" id="pvpLevel" name="streak_min_level" min="0" max="1000" step="1" required aria-describedby="pvpStreakHelp"></label>
    <label for="pvpSheet">Brawls: opponent's sheet games (heists + brawls + arena wins)<input type="number" id="pvpSheet" name="streak_min_sheet_games" min="0" max="1000" step="1" required aria-describedby="pvpStreakHelp"></label>
    <label for="pvpGap">Brawls: how much weaker the loser may be (clash strength)<input type="number" id="pvpGap" name="streak_max_gap" min="0" max="60" step="1" required aria-describedby="pvpStreakHelp"></label>
    <div class="adm-actions"><button class="ds-btn sm" type="submit">Save</button></div>
  </form>
  <script src="/public/js/admin-pvpcfg.js?v=2" defer></script>
  <% } %>
</section>
